{"orgCode":"7730","name":"Franchise Tax Board","agencyCode":"7500","agencyName":"Government Operations","description":"The Franchise Tax Board (FTB) is responsible for collecting personal income tax and corporation tax revenue; operating various collection programs; and conducting field audits for the Fair Political Practices Commission.\n\nBecause the FTB's programs drive a need for infrastructure investment, the FTB has a capital outlay program to support this need. For the specifics on the FTB's capital outlay program see \"Infrastructure Overview.\"","website":"https://www.ftb.ca.gov","totals":{"amounts":{"py":1146579,"cy":1230120,"by":1172833},"positions":{"py":6136.9,"cy":6812.5,"by":6790.3},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":9486,"cy":14621,"by":14633},"nongovernmental":{"py":76,"cy":108,"by":108}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/7500/7730","kind":"department","name":"Franchise Tax Board","code":"7730","amounts":{"py":1146579,"cy":1230120,"by":1172833},"positions":{"py":6136.9,"cy":6812.5,"by":6790.3},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":1126194,"cy":1050648,"by":1145171},"special":{"py":20385,"cy":179472,"by":27662}},"children":[{"id":"exp/7500/7730/6280","kind":"program","name":"Tax Programs","code":"6280","amounts":{"py":1117285,"cy":1197448,"by":1142853},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":1116076,"cy":1194929,"by":1142094},"special":{"py":1209,"cy":2519,"by":759}},"positions":{"py":5620.7,"cy":6234.4,"by":6212.2},"description":"6280 - TAX PROGRAMS\n\nThis program administers the Revenue and Taxation Code by reasonably interpreting and impartially applying the legislatively enacted laws that provide a significant portion of General Fund revenue. The Franchise Tax Board is responsible for administering the personal income tax and the corporation tax. Tax program activities include taxpayer assistance and tax return processing, filing enforcement, audits, and tax collection functions. The program also includes the collection and distribution of voluntary contributions to, and on 